    {
      "id": "s1",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "Small boats loaded with wares sped to the great liner as she was entering the harbour.",
      "translation": "当大型班轮进港时，装满货物的小船向它飞驰而去。",
      "startTime": 16.88,
