        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "Before she had anchored, the men from the boats had climbed on board and the decks were soon covered with colourful rugs from Persia, silks from India, copper coffee pots, and beautiful handmade silverware.",
      "translation": "在大船下锚之前，小船上的人已经爬上了船，甲板上很快就铺满了各种鲜艳的波斯地毯、印度丝绸、铜咖啡壶以及美丽的纯手工银器。",
      "startTime": 23.63,
      "endTime": 40.07,
      "analysis": {
