        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "Many of the tourists on board had begun bargaining with the tradesmen, but I decided not to buy anything until I had disembarked.",
      "translation": "船上的许多游客已经开始和商贩们讨价还价，但我决定在下船之前什么也不买。",
      "startTime": 43.3,
      "endTime": 53.55,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
