        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "I had no sooner got off the ship than I was assailed by a man who wanted to sell me a diamond ring.",
      "translation": "我刚下船，就被一个想卖给我钻戒的人缠住了。",
