        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s6",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "I had no intention of buying one, but I could not conceal the fact that I was impressed by the size of the diamonds.",
      "translation": "我并无意购买，但我无法掩饰一个事实，那就是钻戒的大小给我留下了深刻印象。",
